Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能放心下来了吗  始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩 也谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩的开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑国王殿下今天心情真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为白国王殿下的我 也非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因为大家的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于要到谢幕的时候了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会难过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这虽然是结束但也是开始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还在梦想的途中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:19:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以没有必要难过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧  隼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐在观众席的大家们也别忘了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直都在大家身边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那么多人的声援和思念
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直支持者我们让我们能够站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在平凡的每天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍贵的时间累积起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正式因为有平凡的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.41,0:19:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才有今天光辉的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个相遇让我们渐渐成长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个相遇让我们渐渐变强
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有了和大家共处的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.81,0:19:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,声音歌都能传迭到大家的心里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们要献上这首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们Gravi和Procella送给大家的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.03,0:20:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表面与内在合二为一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两者合一即成明月
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我们的Full Moon诞生啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧 Six Gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.17,0:20:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 Procellorum
